      "created_at": "2025-09-25T12:21:45.688Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Vinay1\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"154373\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/898d66/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vinay1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>role for a user, the user also has employee role. when i logged-in using the role i am able to change all the fields.so why is that am i missed something or did something wrong?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>is Perm Level given for the field in doctype?<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65\" title=\"Screenshot from 2025-09-25 17-50-19\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/8/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65_2_505x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-09-25 17-50-19\" data-base62-sha1=\"3regjosoTF9RNAAElwQp97qgoJv\" width=\"505\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/8/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65_2_505x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/8/181a835350490e060683d0168b66df8eb1fa1d65.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F6F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2025-09-25 17-50-19</span><span class=\"informations\">747×739 36.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
